# Osseous Sticktwister with delirium (as in its first scenario: a Wheel of Fortune fills Bot1's graveyard with four card types
# on turn 1): at Bot1's end step Bot2, holding a Lightning Bolt and six Islands, discards the Bolt. It "didn't discard a card"
# is false, so the Sticktwister deals Bot2 no damage and there is no lifelink gain: both stay at 20. Bot2 has six cards left
# and seven after its turn-2 draw, and its graveyard holds the seven Islands the Wheel discarded and the Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Osseous Sticktwister
Wheel of Fortune
Memnite
Island
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Lightning Bolt
Island x30

[Actions]
